; The tower, for spire(1).  A legend, then the grid.
; It is exactly one screen wide because the world wraps: walk off the
; left and you come back on the right, so there is no edge to the tower,
; only a top.
;
; . sky   # stone (solid)   = ledge (stood on from above only)
; D door  o coin            ~ cloud   ^ the top

. 0 psky
# 1 pstone
= 2 pledge
D 3 pdoor
o 4 pcoin
~ 5 pcloud
^ 6 pgoal
